@startuml MRTR 多轮往返请求
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowparam false
skinparam shadow false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #5A5A5A
skinparam ArrowFontColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #DCE9FB
skinparam SequenceParticipantFontColor #1F2933
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #7A93BE
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBE6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #E0B400
skinparam NoteFontColor #5C4A00

title MRTR:用"请求-重试"取代"长连接反向请求"

participant "Client" as C
participant "Server\n(无状态)" as S

== 第一轮:工具调用发起 ==

C -> S  : tools/call {name: "deploy", params:{...}}

== 服务器需要用户输入(不再保持长连接) ==

S --> C : resultType: "input_required"\n{ requests: [{ id: "env", prompt: "部署到 prod 还是 staging?" }] }

note right of S
  <b>对比有状态痛点</b>
  旧:服务器通过长连接
     反向发起 elicitation
     连接全程占用
  新:服务器直接返回,
     连接立即释放
end note

== 第二轮:客户端带着答案重试同一调用 ==

C -> S  : tools/call {name: "deploy",\n   params:{...},\n   inputResponses: { env: "prod" }}

S --> C : result (部署成功)

note over C, S
  每一轮都是独立的 HTTP 请求
  服务器不持有任何中间状态
  → 完全无状态,却实现了交互式工具
end note

@enduml
